_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/53e75662e5281b09728f196454983830.poster.avif?t=1749572140\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/53e75662e5281b09728f196454983830.webm?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/53e75662e5281b09728f196454983830.mp4?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your inner designer make it cozy or totally chaotic. Change wall and floor colors, remove or add windows. There's literally everything here to make you feel like in your childhood. Have fun to the fullest and remember that only you can decide how your room will look like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/8bd90a42a9c05fa7b067afd201dbcac6.webp?t=1749572140\" width=324 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/fce219706666b2f35e592612651dfc71.poster.avif?t=1749572140\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/fce219706666b2f35e592612651dfc71.webm?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/fce219706666b2f35e592612651dfc71.mp4?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and clear gameplay will give you the ability to put every item wherever you want (yes, you can have a bed in the center of the room too). But your own room is just the beginning, the whole universe needs your help. Chat with digital customers on the freelance exchange, create unique rooms for everyone, buy additional items with the money you earn and enjoy the role of a real designer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/7664c09290fb144b022cb110fdaa434d.webp?t=1749572140\" width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/7df0c7cfcbcdb34feabf5e99b536f0b9.poster.avif?t=1749572140\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/7df0c7cfcbcdb34feabf5e99b536f0b9.webm?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/7df0c7cfcbcdb34feabf5e99b536f0b9.mp4?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, the number of items will make your head spin. Furniture of different colors, shapes and sizes, posters, kitties, computers, lava lamps and even an aquarium! People say that Roomgaze content has only been explored for 5%... But that's not the end of it. Constant item updates and new unique packs are waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/6f0d80fa26a32fd064053024d2536475.poster.avif?t=1749572140\" width=620 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643220/extras/6f0d80fa26a32fd064053024d2536475.webm?t=1749572140\" type=\"video/w